  m_text: "Dear all staff,\r\n\r\nIn the event of an emergency this building will
    go into a lockdown to prevent any of the specimens from escaping the facility.
    To release the lockdown, you need to get authorisation from myself\r\n\r\nIn
    the event that I am either desist or occupied and has given authorisation, you
    can release the lock down from my computer in my office. \r\n\r\nYours sincerely
    \r\n\r\nDoctor Clockwork head of Clockwork laboratory. \r\n"
